      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso ba mu Yuda bakangata Uziya, wakadi ne bidimu dikumi ne bisambombo, bakamuhingisha mu bukelenge mu muaba wa tatuʼandi Amasaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakasa Elota, wakahingisha musoko eu ku luseke lua Yuda; ku nyima kua bualu ebu mukelenge wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya wakadi ne bidimu dikumi ne bisambombo hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema bidimu makumi atanu ne bibidi. Dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Yekoliya wa mu Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye Wakenza malu mimpe ku mesu kua Yehowa, bu muakenza Amasaya tatuʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakajadika mutshima wandi bua kukebeye Nzambi mu matuku a Zekâya nguakamanya mua kujingulula bikena kumona bia Nzambi; musangu wonso wakadiye ukeba Yehowa, Nzambi wakamuvudishila diakalengele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakaya kuluangana ne Bena Peleshete, wakashimbula ngumbu ya Gata ne ya Yabene ne ya Ashedodo; yeye wakasa misoko mikuabo mu buloba bua Ashedodo munkatshi mua Bena Peleshete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wakamukuatshisha bua kuluanganeye ne Bena Peleshete, ne Bena Alabâ bakadi bashikama mu Gû-bâla ne Bena Meunima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Amona bakalambula Uziya; lumu luandi luakamanyibua tô ne ku tshibuelelu tshia ku Ejipitu, bualu bua yeye wakalua muena bukole bua bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya wakasa bibumba mu Yelushalema ku tshibi tshia ku ditumba dia lumbu, ne ku tshibi tshia mu tshibanda, ne ku ditumba dikuabo dia lumbu, wakatekamu bintu bia nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakasa bibumba mu tshihela kabidi, wakimba mena a mai, bualu bua yeye wakadi ne bimuna bia bungi; Wakenza nunku mu bibanda ne mu mpata kabidi; yeye wakadi ne bidime ne balami ba mionshi ya tumuma tukese mu mikuna ne mu maloba mimpe; bualu bua yeye wakananga mudimu wa budimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya wakadi ne bena nvita ba bungi, bakaya bua kuluangana mu bisumbu biabo bu muakabatahulula Yeiele mufundi ne Mâseya kahita, bakadi mu bianza bia Hananya, kapitene kakuabo ka mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bungi bua bantu bakadi ku mutu kua nsubu ya batatuʼabo, bena nvita ba bukitu, buakadi binunu bibidi ne nkama isambombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena nvita binunu nkama isatu ne muanda mutekete ne nkama itanu bakadi mu bianza biabo, bakadi baluangana nvita bikole, bua kukuatshisha mukelenge bua kudisheye bena lukuna bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya wakabalongoluela, buonso buabo mene, ngabu ne mafuma, ne bifulu bia tshiamu ne bikowelu bia tshiamu ne mata ne mabue a kuela mu bielelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakenzesha mashine mu Yelushalema kudi bantu ba lungenyi lule, bua kuteka mu bibumba ne ha mutu ha ngumbu a kuela nʼau mikete ne mabue manene. Dina diandi diakamanyibua kuonso; bualu bua Nzambi wakamukuatshisha bikole, tô ne bakalueye muena bukole bua bungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi hakalueye muena bukole bua bungi yeye wakadisua mu mutshima wandi, wakenza malu mabi, wakatombokela Yehowa Nzambi wandi; bualu bua yeye wakabuela mu ntempelo wa Yehowa bua kuosheleye Yehowa musenga wa manananshi ku tshioshelu tshia manananshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaya muakuidi wakamulonda ne bakuidi ba Yehowa makumi muanda mukulu bakadi bena bukitu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bobo bakakandisha Uziya mukelenge, bakamuambila ne, Uziya, kambualu buebe bua kuoshela Yehowa musenga wa manananshi, kadi mbua bakuidi, bana ba Alona, badi bajidibue bua kuoshela Yehowa manananshi; umuka mu muaba eu wa tshijila, bualu bua wewe wakuenza bibi; bualu ebu kabuena bukuvuisha butumbi kudi Yehowa Nzambi nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Uziya wakakuata tshiji; yeye wakadi ne dilonga dia kuoshelamu musenga wa manananshi mu tshianza tshiandi; hakadiye ne bakuidi tshiji, nsudi yakahatuka ha mpala wandi ku mesu kua bakuidi mu nsubu wa Yehowa, hehi ne tshioshelu tshia musenga wa manananshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaya, muakuidi munene, ne bakuidi bonso bakamutangila ne, monai, yeye wakadi ne nsudi ha mpala handi, bakamûmusha lukasa; yeye kabidi wakahatuka lukasa, bualu bua Yehowa wakamana kumukengesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya mukelenge wakadi muena nsudi tô ne ku dituku dia lufu luandi; wakashikama mu nsubu ha nkayandi, bualu bua yeye wakadi muena nsudi; bualu bua yeye wakadi mukandibue ne, Kubuedi mu nsubu wa Yehowa; Yotama muanʼandi wakadi ha mutu ha ba mu nsubu wa mukelenge, wakakokesha bena buloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bikuabo bia Uziya bia kumudilu ne bia kunshikidilu, Yeshaya, muprofete, muana wa Amoza, wakabifunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Uziya wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi; bakamujika diatshimue ne bankambua bandi mu muaba udibo bajika bakelenge, bualu bua bakamba ne, Yeye udi muena nsudi; Yotama muanʼandi wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
